  "an6.100:0.3": "5. Anattasuttaṃ ",
  "an6.100:1.1": "‘‘So vata, bhikkhave, bhikkhu kañci dhammaṃ attato samanupassanto…pe… ",
  "an6.100:1.2": "sabbadhamme anattato samanupassanto…pe… ",
  "an6.100:1.3": "ṭhānametaṃ vijjati’’. ",
  "an6.100:1.4": "Pañcamaṃ. "
}
